---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<section class="next-chapter" aria-labelledby="next-chapter-title">
  <div class="wrap next-chapter-grid">
    <div><span class="next-chapter-label">THE ARCHIVE IS OPEN</span><h2 id="next-chapter-title">There’s always<br /><em>another beginning.</em></h2></div>
    <div class="next-chapter-copy"><p>Find a new question, step into another world, or follow the story that speaks to you.</p><div class="next-chapter-actions"><a href={`${base}/discover/`}>Find your next read <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href={`${base}/#index`}>Browse all books <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div>
  </div>
</section>
